A delimited body's overlapping header and footer make no header cells

````
{table header-rows=2 footer-rows=1}
```csv
a
b
```
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><td>a</td></tr>
    <tr><td>b</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
````

```
|= a |
| ^ |
+ | c |
.
<table>
  <tbody>
    <tr><th scope="col" rowspan="2">a</th></tr>
    <tr><td>c</td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
```
